### Step 1 deploy new contracts (for cloning)
POST http://localhost:4000/contract/deploy HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: 'application/json'

{
    "name": "None"
}

### Step 2 deploy factory

POST http://localhost:4000/contract/deployFactory HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: 'application/json'

{
    "name": "-",
    "proxy_address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512"
}

### Step 3 clone

POST http://localhost:4000/contract/clone HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: 'application/json'

{
    "org_id": 1,
    "template_id": 1,
    "uuid": "0000-11111-26",
    "name": "Certified Developer II",
    "baseUri": "https://localhost:3000/api/media/",
    "factory_address": "0x2279B7A0a67DB372996a5FaB50D91eAA73d2eBe6",
    "contract_address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512",
    "delegate_address": "0x5FbDB2315678afecb367f032d93F642f64180aa3",
    "description": "ChainXP Series #8",
    "image_url": "https://chainxp.sgp1.digitaloceanspaces.com/prod/template/xp-template-1.gif",
    "slug": "level-5",
    "requirements": "Nothing."
}

### Step 4a addClass (contract)
POST http://localhost:4000/contract/0x9c774fe3a8b99902731513e218332c0aeb1573d6/class HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: 'application/json'

{
    "series_id": 130,
    "name": "Class 1",
    "title": "Series Class 1",
    "desc": "Series Class 1 description",
    "image_url": "asdfasf",
    "slug": "class-1",
    "template": "0xCf7Ed3AccA5a467e9e704C703E8D87F634fB0Fc9"
}

### Step 5 mint from API via contract service
PUT http://localhost:4000/contract/0x9c774fe3a8b99902731513e218332c0aeb1573d6/mint/1?address=0x77fC1370F4D88b4446cc5d2a2FDAd2F91AA982D0 HTTP/1.1
